  "description": {
    "de": "The National Inventory Document 2026 (NID 2026) gives a detailed and comprehensive description of the trend and the methodologies applied in the Austrian air emissions inventory for the greenhouse gases carbon dioxide, methane, nitrous oxide, HFC, PFC, SF6 and NF3. With this report, Austria complies with its reporting obligations under the EU Governance Regulation No 2018/1999 as well as the UNFCCC and the Paris Agreement by providing transparent and verifiable documentation."
  },
